<title>LUXEMBOURG: Juncker sees stability pact accord at EU summit.</title>
<headline>Juncker sees stability pact accord at EU summit.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxembourg Finance Minister Jean-Claude Juncker said on Sunday he believed the European Union would find the means to approve its stability pact at the EU summit in Amsterdam next week.</p>
<p>&quot;We will find the ways and means,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
